# A competing gene model for the synthetic example: geneA and geneB merged into one gene (the hypothesis the evidence hints at).
# Not part of the bundle; score it against the bundle's evidence with:
#   python scripts/summarise_gene.py examples/minimal/bundle geneAB --annotation examples/minimal/competing_model_AB.gff3
